# Mazemind Tome's state trigger ("When there are four or more page counters on this artifact, exile it. If you do, you
# gain 4 life") "doesn't trigger again until the ability has resolved, has been countered, or has otherwise left the
# stack" (CR 603.8). Bot1 puts the fourth page counter on turn 7 and, with the trigger on the stack, casts Lightning Bolt
# at Bot2 off a Mox Ruby: the state is still true through the cast, the Bolt's damage and every priority after, but the
# waiting trigger is the only one - once the Bolt has resolved the stack holds it and the scry, no second trigger - and
# Bot1 gains 4 life once.

